# agent_tester + stack

## ADK / LiteLLM (`agents/llm.py`)

```python
LiteLlm(
    model=f"openai/{settings.llm_model}",
    api_base=settings.llm_base_url,  # must end with /v1
    api_key=settings.llm_api_key,
    max_tokens=...,
    # response_format={"type": "json_object"} only if LLM_JSON_MODE and non-tester
)
```

- `run_agent(..., retry=True)` only for planner/reviewer/judge — never auto-retry testers after a write.
- Cap concurrency with `LLM_MAX_CONCURRENCY`. Lazy-import ADK so unittest works offline.
- No local fallback model wired; if host won't resolve, fail fast (`model_host_ok`).

## Playwright MCP (`agents/tester.py`)

```text
npx -y @playwright/mcp@latest [--headless] --user-data-dir runs/<run>/profiles/<app>
  --output-dir runs/<run>/shots --viewport-size 1366,900
```

- `McpToolset` + `StdioConnectionParams` + `StdioServerParameters(command="npx", args=..., env=os.environ)`.
- Site policy in code (`Policy` / after_tool) — never re-add `--allowed-origins`.
- Block evaluate / run_code / install / file_upload. Action log from callbacks, not model prose.
- Judge: brief + action log + values + evidence names — never tester opinions.

## Helpers & values

- Deterministic UI → `helpers` (`HELPER` + `run`) via `run_helper`.
- Numbers → page extract + `tools/values.calculate` (no `eval`).
- Passwords typed only inside helpers/tools from env.

## Evidence & limits (HANDOVER)

- Evidence paths absolute under `runs/<run>/shots/`; verify file exists.
- Verify steps need `record_value`/observation before successful `mark_step`.
- Context: prune page reads, cap chars, smaller `TESTER_MAX_TOKENS`; context errors → `AGENT INCOMPLETE` for the case.
- Tool budget 40/case is tight for CRM — scale with steps if changing limits.

## Tests

`.venv/bin/python -m unittest discover -s tests -t .`
